  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase-Out of HCFC-22 and HCFC-142b from the Manufacture of Extruded Polystyrene Panel at Line #2 in Arabian Chemical Company</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC-22 and HCFC-142 used in the manufacture of extruded polystyrene insulation boards at the line #2 in Arabian Chemical Company will be phased out by converting to the iso-butane technology. Immediate impact of the project is to phase-out the use of 500 MT of HCFC-22 and 100 MT of HCFC-142b by converting to the iso-butane technology, thereby contributing to the HCFC phase-out in the XPS sector as a flagship project.  Accordingly it contributes to the country#s obligation to reduce HCFCs consumption by 10% in 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
